B.agU=new A.h4("\ud83c\udf33 Hutan Lestari!","Kamu sudah jaga 26 tempat di hutan. Pohon kembali subur, hewan kembali pulang. Kamu sekarang Penjaga Hutan! Terus jaga lingkungan ya.")
B.agK=new A.h4("\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f Pantai Bersih!","Pantai jadi bersih, penyu bertelur dengan aman. Kamu pahlawan laut! Ingat: buang sampah di tempatnya, di mana pun kamu berada.")
B.agM=new A.h4("\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Sahabat Desa!","Kamu bantu kakek, nenek, guru, dan teman di desa pegunungan. Hormat & tolong-menolong bikin desa damai. Kamu Sahabat Pegunungan!")
B.agR=new A.h4("\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Warga Kota yang Jujur!","Kamu jaga kejujuran di sekolah, warung, dan jalan. Kota yang baik mulai dari satu anak yang jujur \u2014 dan itu kamu!")
B.agL=new A.h4("\ud83c\udf0a Pahlawan Laut!","Karang sehat, ikan kembali, paus bisa lewat lagi. Laut Indonesia jadi kebanggaan dunia. Lanjutkan jagainya!")
B.agQ=new A.h4("\ud83d\ude80 Penjelajah Angkasa!","Kamu sampai bintang. Tapi yang paling penting: di Bumi pun kamu sudah jadi orang baik. Selamat, Penjelajah!")
B.a1l=new A.bm([1,B.agU,2,B.agK,3,B.agM,4,B.agR,5,B.agL,6,B.agQ],t.hL)
B.agI=new A.h4("\ud83c\udf33 Forest Restored!","You cared for 26 spots in the forest. The trees are green again and the animals came home. You are now a Forest Keeper! Keep caring for nature.")
B.agS=new A.h4("\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f Clean Beach!","The beach is clean and the turtles can lay eggs safely. You are a sea hero! Remember: put trash in the bin, wherever you are.")
B.agP=new A.h4("\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Village Friend!","You helped grandpa, grandma, the teacher, and friends in the mountain village. Respect and helping out make a village happy. You are a Mountain Friend!")
B.agJ=new A.h4("\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f An Honest City Kid!","You stayed honest at school, at the shop, and on the street. A good city starts with one honest kid \u2014 and that is you!")
B.agN=new A.h4("\ud83c\udf0a Sea Hero!","The coral is healthy, the fish are back, and the whales can pass again. Indonesia's sea makes the world proud. Keep protecting it!")
B.agV=new A.h4("\ud83d\ude80 Space Explorer!","You reached the stars. But the most important thing: back on Earth you became a good person. Well done, Explorer!")
