B.MJ=new A.y("High Village","Kiko reaches a village at the foot of the mountain. Greet grandpa first!","A polite greeting \u2014 a good habit anywhere.",B.S)
B.PR=new A.y("Bamboo Bridge","The village's bamboo bridge is getting shaky. The people fix it together.","Working together makes hard work feel light.",B.q)
B.MB=new A.y("Tea Garden","Grandma picks tea leaves on the slope. Let us help gently.","Helping elders' work warms the heart.",B.q)
B.MH=new A.y("Grandma's Chickens","Grandma's chickens escaped the coop. Help round them up!","Small responsibility today trains us for the big ones later.",B.K)
B.P3=new A.y("Village Well","One well is shared by many families. Take water in turns.","Queue and share the water \u2014 fair for all the neighbors.",B.K)
