B.Qc=new A.y("Ringed Planet","Saturn has lovely rings of ice and rock. Amazing!","Learning makes us admire nature even more.",B.S)
B.M0=new A.y("Giant Telescope","A giant telescope can see far galaxies. The work of scientists.","Value the hard work of those who advance knowledge.",B.S)
